OL,3,GNEWSASisters' cricket brand wins #50k
OL,4,ADragons' Den deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers who set up a women's
OL,7,Fcricket equipment company after feeling
OL,8,Fthe sport was less accessible for them
OL,9,Fsay they felt nervous to appear on
OL,10,FDragons' Den before receiving a #50,000
OL,11,Finvestment.
OL,13,FCat and Honor, 17 and 19, set up Maiden
OL,14,FCricket to create purpose-made
OL,15,Fsportswear for women after previously
OL,16,Fhaving to wear ill-fitting kit, as it
OL,17,Fhad been designed for the men's game.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
