OL,3,GNEWSASisters' cricket brand wins #50k
OL,4,ADragons' Den deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sisters, from Chichester, West
OL,7,FSussex, received offers from all five
OL,8,FDragons while appearing on the BBC One
OL,9,Fshow on Thursday, before finally
OL,10,Faccepting a deal from all five
OL,11,Finvestors.
OL,13,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Sussex, Honor
OL,14,Fsaid: "We want girls to feel like the
OL,15,Fsport was more made for them."
